<includeonly>{{#invoke:Map|regionCard}}</includeonly><noinclude>
A card for a town, dungeon or area, with coloured tags and longer text that appears on hover.

<pre>
{{Region card|name=Aridian Dungeon|tags=Dungeon, Resources, Boss|level=Level 10-20|colour=orange|text=Ancient ruins filled with challenges and treasures.|more=A treacherous underground labyrinth.}}
</pre>

Part of the [[Project:Design kit|design kit]]. Marker types are listed in [[Module:Map/types]].

